*Ninja** build system generator (fast, minimal output) instead of the default Makefiles.\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n```\nOptimize for performance (`-O3`, strip debug symbols). This is the production build type.\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib\n```\n- **`-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr`** \u2014 Where `make install` will place files (standard system location).\n- **`-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR="}